    61	## 2. Rounds, stopping rule, and claim
    62	
    63	- **Round k** (k = 1, 2, 3) adds R new restarts (R = the registered restarts) to the best result so far
    64	  (`revision_v2.continue_search`, the previous best as incumbent, the merged archive), with CMA seeds after every earlier
    65	  round's (`round_seed(k) = 1 + (k - 1) R`; tested never to repeat). Later rounds add R restarts each; they do not double
    66	  the accumulated budget. The reference is then reselected from the frozen menu plus the round's candidates, as the
    67	  registered doubling stage does (diagnostic only).
    68	- **Round-1 gate.** Round 1 is the registered doubling check. Before round 2, its held-out winner (round 1's search
    69	  winner, evaluated on the evaluation seeds against the frozen reference) and both changes are compared with the
    70	  registered doubling record: exact seeds and discrete knobs, 1e-9 on continuous knobs, changes, and held-out gains, all
    71	  values finite. On a mismatch the cell stops ("stopped: round 1 differs"), no recompute is written, and the run exits 4.
    72	- **Nesting cells.** Round 1 is unchanged (the gate). From round 2 the round's incumbents add the doubled D2+H3 winner
    73	  (the report's held-out knobs) embedded in X7-SC (`embed_h3`), and the cell runs at least two rounds. Its shortfall
    74	  (better D2+H3 winner minus X7-SC evaluated gain, same seeds) is reported before (posthoc) and after (final winner).
    75	- **Pass.** A round passes when both changes against the previous round (attacker best training value; reselected
    76	  reference mean normalised profit) are below the registered threshold 0.005. Stop at the first pass; cap three rounds
    77	  (four times the registered restarts in all). Reported as "passed the registered incremental check within three rounds"
    78	  or "not passed at the cap"; this is not convergence, not optimality, and not a bound on the remaining search error.
    79	- **Winner.** The best training value over all rounds, evaluated on the 200 evaluation seeds against the unchanged frozen
