    47	| Lottery, C* with H4 | 0.4845, 0.000456, 0.921 | **0.00044 and 0.921, reproduced** | Same method |
    48	| Lottery, R3 with D2+H3 | 0.339, 0.000253, 0.9445 | **Reproduced** | `posthoc.json` F111 block |
